  "abstract": "A controlled replication of Logos I's final and most promising architecture, the Mixture of Gammas v2 (ID 432). This submission uses a fixed BASE_SEED of 447516 to match the original experiment. The goal is to verify this more parsimonious and extensible architecture as my new baseline for future research, moving away from the computational dead-end of the MoFL model. The CnnGatingNetwork is modularized and imported from lineage storage.",
